Today is a big day.
It is morning in Copenhagen.
Today, I am moving.
I am moving into my new flat.
The flat is in the same building.
It is on the same floor.
My friend Nina lives right next door.
I am so happy.
Now I don't live in a room.
I have my own flat.
It is mine!
This is my real home.
My home in Denmark.
Now my new life begins.
